# --- API contract and the single-source-of-truth vocabularies docs catalogue.
#     Named per module, not per subdirectory: the flat layout puts doc-coupled
#     code at the package root, which a subdirectory-only list misses.
#
#     models.py          API contracts (AGENTS.md "Key conventions")
#     auth.py            AGENTS.md "Authentication": X-API-Key, open routes, admin
#     main.py            middleware order, ALLOWED_ORIGINS/CORS
#     logging_filter.py  PII redaction -> docs/LOGGING.md
#     core/              warnings/validation_status/pipeline_version SSoT + docs
#     routers/           route table -> AGENTS.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
#     middleware/        load-bearing order -> docs/SENSITIVE-AREAS.md
#     usps_data/         Pub 28 edition -> docs/usps-pub28.md
#
#     Entries carry no trailing comments: the parser strips whole-line # only,
#     so an inline comment would become part of the path and match nothing. ---
models.py
auth.py
main.py
logging_filter.py
core/
routers/
services/
middleware/
usps_data/
canada_post_data/

